<title>SOUTH KOREA: Yukong 200,000-bpd CDU NO-5 restarts.</title>
<headline>Yukong 200,000-bpd CDU NO-5 restarts.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Yukong Ltd said on Wednesday its 200,000-bpd crude distillation unit (CDU) number five had resumed operations Tuesday after being shut down for almost a month for maintenance.</p>
<p>A company official said the unit would operate at 20 percent capacity through Wednesday and begin operating at full capacity from Thursday.</p>
<p>Yukong is South Korea's largest oil refiner.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (+822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
